cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OVERBOARD: time-optimal trajectories for a LEGO differential-drive robot"
abstract: >-
  A planner that generates time-optimal, physically constrained trajectories
  for a LEGO/FLL differential-drive robot with CasADi and IPOPT, validates them
  against a reachability gate, and exports them for a Pybricks Ramsete
  controller.
type: software
version: "0.1.0a2"
date-released: "2026-10-26"
